        },
        {
          "text": "Nekubaboobo ijwi lyamwami lyakayumisya kwiinda Joabu, aboobo Joabu wakainka kuya bweendeenda, wamanisya cisi coonse ca-Israyeli, wapiluka ku-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Joabu wakalwiida Davida mweelwe wabantu. Ba-Israyeli boonse bakasika kuzyuulu zili cuulu azyuulu zili mwaanda, nkukuti baalumi ibakezi kulwisya ipanga, abantu ba-Juda bakasika kuzyuulu zili myaanda yone azyuulu zili makumi aali musanu aabili, baalumi ibakezi kulwisya ipanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
