                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na myaka yotatwe yanzala, na myezi yotatwe yakukomwa abasikaambonyoko, ipanga lyabasinkondonyoko nilili kukutanda, na mazuba otatwe aapanga lya-Jehova, bulwazi nibuli mukusaalila munyika, alakwe angelo wa-Jehova naali mukunyonyoona mucisi coonse ca-Israyeli, Kosola makani, kuti mbweedezye ijwi kuliyooyo iwakandituma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.12",
