                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi Leza wakatuma angelo ku-Jerusalemu kuti aunyonyoone, pele naakasi nyonyoone, Jehova wakabona, wausa insoni kumakani ayo aakubisizya, waambila angelo sikunyonyoona kuti, Cazulila, leka lino, Nkabela angelo wa-Jehova wakaliimvwi kucipolelo ca-Orinani mu-Jebusi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mak 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida naakapungula kujulu, wakabona angelo wa-Jehova uliimvwi akati kanyika ajulu, apanga lyakwe lilisomwedwe mujanza lyakwe, lilitandabikidwe kuJerusalemu, elyo Davida abapati mbaakali abo bakavundamina ansi, kabasamide zisani zyamasaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Davida wakaambila Leza kuti, Sa teensi ndime ndakalailila kuti bantu babalwe. Ndime ndakabisya akucita bubi loko, pele imbelele ezi zyabisyanzi? O Jehova Leza wangu, ijanza lyako lilemene ndime aluzubo lwataata, pele bantu bako batakataazigwi pe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
